---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/components.css';
const schema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Product", "name": "Garden Office Pods", "description": "Insulated turnkey garden office pods", "brand": {"@type": "Brand", "name": "Revonia"}, "offers": {"@type": "AggregateOffer", "priceCurrency": "GBP", "lowPrice": "45000", "offerCount": 1}, "manufacturer": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "Luxury Modules", "url": "https://luxurymodules.co.uk", "description": "Official UK partner of Revonia. Turnkey vaulted living spaces, cellars and saunas."}};
---
<Layout title="Garden Office Pods: Insulated & Turnkey | Luxury Modules" description="A garden office pod you can use all year: fully insulated, underfloor heating, installed with planning handled. From-pricing, sizes and floorplans." schema={schema}>
<div class="pagehero">
  <p class="kicker">Use Case · Work</p>
  <h1>Garden offices built for every working day</h1>
  <p>A garden office pod you can use every day of the year: fully insulated, underfloor heating, silent, and installed with planning handled. Not a shed with a desk — a workplace buried in your garden.</p>
  <div class="price-anchor">From £45,000</div>
  <div style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a> <a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure" style="margin-left:8px">Download Brochure</a></div>
</div>
<div class="strip">Official UK Partner of <b>Revonia</b> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>1,500+</b> projects across Europe &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <b>25-year</b> structural warranty &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Planning <b>handled for you</b></div>
<div class="imgph hero"><img class="real" src="/images/garden-office-working-interior.webp" alt="Garden office pod interior: desk and screen beneath the vaulted ceiling, kitchenette behind"><span class="lbl">ASSET: garden-office-working-interior.webp — final</span></div>
<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Difference</p><h2>A garden office pod, not a shed with a desk</h2>
  <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:14px">Also searched as: insulated garden office &middot; small garden office &middot; office pod</p><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead">Most garden offices are timber boxes that cook in July and need a fan heater in January. An earth-sheltered pod holds a working temperature all year, blocks the mower next door mid-call, and comes with underfloor heating, full insulation and real acoustic mass as standard — because it is built from vaulted concrete, not cladding.</p>
  <div class="grid cols4" style="margin-top:36px">
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Year-round</h3><p>Stable temperature in heatwave and frost — the earth is the insulation.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Silent</h3><p>Concrete mass and earth cover give call-quality quiet, both directions.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Wired for work</h3><p>Mains power, network-ready, thermostat per room, triple-glazed daylight.</p></div></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="body"><h3>Planning handled</h3><p>Applications, drawings and submissions managed for you, end to end.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="navy-band"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Honest Numbers</p><h2>What a garden office costs</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:28px">Garden office pods start at &pound;45,000 turnkey in the Small Living range — groundworks, install, connections, heating and finish included. Every site is different; final pricing follows the scoping call and site assessment. Full range pricing is on the <a href="/pricing/" style="color:var(--gold2);font-weight:600">pricing page</a>.</p>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Sizes</p><h2>Sizes and layouts</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:30px">Most offices are built from the <a href="/products/small-living-spaces/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Small Living range (10–29m&sup2;)</a>: Modular 10 or MINI 10 for a one-person studio, Modular 20 for office plus meeting space, Modular A when the office should also be the best room on the property.</p>
  <div class="grid cols3">
  <div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-10-small-living.jpg" alt="Modular 10 garden office pod"><span class="lbl">ASSET IN FOLDER → ../Modular_10_Small_Living.jpg</span></div><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-20-small-living.jpg" alt="Modular 20 garden office layout"><span class="lbl">ASSET IN FOLDER → ../Modular_20_Small_Living.jpg</span></div><div class="imgph "><img class="real" src="/images/modular-a-small-living.jpg" alt="Modular A luxury garden office"><span class="lbl">ASSET IN FOLDER → ../Modular_A_small_living.jpg</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">The Rules</p><h2>Planning permission for a garden office</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:26px">Many garden offices fall within permitted development, and where consent is needed, we manage it. The full rules — sizes, heights, boundaries — are in our <a href="/planning-permission/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">planning permission guide</a>.</p>
</div></section>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">Hybrid</p><h2>Office and gym in one?</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:26px">A 20m&sup2; layout splits cleanly into desk space and training space — the most requested hybrid we build. See the <a href="/spaces/garden-gym/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">garden gym</a> page for the training half.</p>
</div></section>
<section style="background:#efe9db"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="kicker">FAQ</p><h2>Your questions, answered</h2><div class="gold-rule"></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Can I use a garden office all year round?</h3><p>Yes — that is the point of building it earth-sheltered. Full insulation and underfloor heating are standard, not upgrades, so it works in January exactly as it does in June.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>How long does a garden office take to install?</h3><p>The module itself installs in hours; groundworks and connections take days. From first call to working in it, allow for the planning window — which we manage.</p></div><div class="faq-item"><h3>Will a garden office add value to my home?</h3><p>A permanent, insulated, warrantied structure is generally viewed by valuers as adding utility and value, unlike timber outbuildings which depreciate. See the FAQ for the honest detail.</p></div>
  <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px">More questions? <a href="/faq/" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">See the full FAQ</a>.</p>
</div></section><section class="ctaband" id="cta">
  <h2>Your commute, redesigned</h2>
  <p>Book a scoping call to plan a garden office for your site — or take the brochure to your kitchen table first.</p>
  <div class="btns"><a class="btn" href="/book-a-call/">Book a Scoping Call</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#brochure">Download the Brochure</a></div>
  
  <!-- BUILD NOTE: brochure CTA = HubSpot email-only form (hidden fields: product_interest, product_range, audience_type, source_page_url). Scoping CTA -> contact.html until /book-a-call/ with calendar embed exists. -->
</section>
</Layout>
